The other stars watched in wonder. Encouraged, another star began to glow, then another, and another. Soon, thousands of lights blazed across the sky, each adding their unique brilliance.

The Moon smiled. "Alone, you shine dimly. But together, you transform the night into something magnificent."

From that moment forward, the stars remembered their purpose—not to outshine the darkness alone, but to join together in creating beauty from their collective light.
